<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>This function is a move to object command constructor.
It creates a move to object command which can then be added to any
object's command queue. This command, when processed will attempt to
move the creature to target object.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>Only creatures can move, non-creature objects that have a move command assigned to them will fail the command when attempting to process it.
</p>
